The '''Confessional Tree''' is an [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] that appears in [[Heartbeat Catcademy#List of Stages|Weekend: Confession]]. It was added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Confessional Tree
|image = E 602.png
|appearance = [[Heartbeat Catcademy#List of Stages|Weekend: Confession]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
It does nothing despite its special treatment as an animated base, basically acting as a regular base that can be hurt by [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s.

